{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T01:13:53.451Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_044b9c7c4d3e7db0016a73dfcf89bc81918482eb824e3e0896","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The repaired source stack now has a clean Angular baseline: 133 files and 961 tests all pass. A strict platform guard then caught two real pieces that were lost in the original monolithic split—typed audit summaries and bounded platform-event questions. I’m restoring those as one focused platform-contract PR, while plain administrator wording stays in the dedicated copy PR. Projected final stack: 99 draft PRs, with no spare fixup branches."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fd2d8-aa27-7b33-9da1-34e7e79b653d"}}}
