{"timestamp":"2026-08-06T01:14:27.730Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019fd4a2-d012-7012-8cf6-31b0aa6478bf","call_id":"call_e9kdo9ZXt3YamfmwNaAY9s3E","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/complete_manifest\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/docker_preflight_diagnosis\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Docker diagnosis and permanent-fix patch are complete. No shared worktree, Git refs, or Docker state were changed.\\n\\nThe current project was not actively hung: only a stale, healthy database container remained. Its Compose configuration hash and mounts differed from the current configuration, while all other required services were absent. Existing `docker:start`, `docker:stop`, and `docker:resume` paths could wait indefinitely on Compose client calls.\\n\\nPrepared patch:\\n\\n- [0001-fix-bound-local-docker-lifecycle-commands.patch](/tmp/evorto-docker-lifecycle-fix-final-v2/0001-fix-bound-local-docker-lifecycle-commands.patch)\\n- SHA-256: `ab0e7c438b04b69753c8bd3a0a9862bfdd24b0d933efd595ca306aa4be56ea6e`\\n- Commit: `d027caf5247a60fc2c6d3cf271252f6f824f60b0`\\n\\nIt adds bounded lifecycle commands, explicit timeout diagnostics, project-name safeguards, all-container status reporting, and deterministic tests without retries or recovery fallbacks.\\n\\nVerification passed:\\n\\n- Formatting and lint\\n- Shell syntax\\n- Patch whitespace validation\\n- 47 focused lifecycle/preflight tests with zero incomplete tests\\n\\nThe broader server suite remains red because the source snapshot is a mid-stack commit with unrelated incomplete application changes; the Docker-focused tests remain green. The patch should be rebased and re-exported once against the final assembled stack tip. The exact project-scoped reset/start/readiness sequence has been supplied to the coordinator.\\n\\n\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/event_discovery_templates\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Finalized the owner split without editing the shared worktree.\\n\\n- Branch 61: `/tmp/evorto-owner-amendment-deltas-v2/0061-registration-eligibility-inner-join-mock.patch`\\n  - Owner: `codex/recheck-registration-eligibility-on-writes` at `00e5c4be188…`\\n  - 1 file, +33/-10\\n  - SHA-256: `618507715ef956dcf0d4312a68cee28cc81dfa22b892e0bdde7cda869d11c53b`\\n  - Focused tests: 95/95 passed\\n\\n- Branch 79: `/tmp/evorto-owner-amendment-deltas-v2/0079-derive-discovery-owner-fixes.patch`\\n  - Owner: `codex/derive-event-discovery-from-sign-up-options` at `c854ff97c6a…`\\n  - 29 files, +31/-461\\n  - SHA-256: `651c669dd19ae20a3e4086f40a065d617b24db154677fcaee41e856702c43736`\\n\\nBoth apply cleanly to their exact owner trees and reconstruct the same corrected tree as the superseded combined delta.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/event_discovery_templates/final_source_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Core source behavior is clean for authorization, tenant isolation, direct-link outcomes, template structure, and announcement targeting.\\n\\nOne confirmed defect remains:\\n\\n- `events:viewPublic` is still presented as a configurable permission in `src/shared/permissions/permissions.ts`, but no runtime path enforces it. Remove this misleading no-op permission and its seed/test references.\\n\\nStack caveat:\\n\\n- The discovery commit removes `unlisted` and old listing permissions while Playwright/generated-documentation sources still reference them. The planned replacement patch must directly follow or be folded into that slice; otherwise intermediate PRs are not independently full-suite compliant.\\n\\nAll patches satisfy review limits: 3/23/34/33 files and 100/113/740/1,242 changed lines.\\n\\nRemaining proof gaps are PostgreSQL-backed discovery/role-transition checks and Browser/Playwright verification of direct-link and announcement journeys.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/stack_ui_test_layers\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/stack_ui_test_layers/audit_final_guards\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/stack_ui_test_layers/audit_generated_guard\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/stack_ui_test_layers/audit_generated_guard/fix_platform_authority_guard\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fd2d8-aa27-7b33-9da1-34e7e79b653d"}}}
