ver the user mentions Swift, SwiftUI, iOS, (file: r6/figma-swiftui/SKILL.md)\n- figma:figma-use: **MANDATORY prerequisite** — you MUST invoke this skill BEFORE every `use_figma` (file: r6/figma-use/SKILL.md)\n- figma:figma-use-figjam: This skill helps agents use Figma's use_figma MCP tool in the FigJam context. Ca (file: r6/figma-use-figjam/SKILL.md)\n- figma:figma-use-motion: Motion / animation context for the `use_figma` MCP tool — animating Figma nodes vi (file: r6/figma-use-motion/SKILL.md)\n- figma:figma-use-slides: This skill helps agents use Figma's use_figma MCP tool in the Slides context. Ca (file: r6/figma-use-slides/SKILL.md)\n- find-skills: Helps users discover and install agent skills when they ask questions like \"how  (file: r1/find-skills/SKILL.md)\n- gh-stack: Manages stacked PRs and splits multi-part work into reviewable branches with gh-st (file: r1/gh-stack/SKILL.md)\n- gmail:gmail: Manage Gmail search, thread reading, summaries, reply or forward drafts, self-d (file: r7/gmail/0.1.6/skills/gmail/SKILL.md)\n- google-calendar:google-calendar: Manage scheduling and conflicts in connected Google Calendar data. Use when the  (file: r8/google-calendar/SKILL.md)\n- google-calendar:google-calendar-daily-brief: Build polished one-day Google Calendar briefs. Use when the user asks for today, (file: r8/google-calendar-daily-brief/SKILL.md)\n- google-calendar:google-calendar-free-up-time: Find ways to open up meaningful free time in a connected Google Calendar. Use when (file: r8/google-calendar-free-up-time/SKILL.md)\n- google-calendar:google-calendar-group-scheduler: Find and rank good meeting times for multiple people using connected Google Cale (file: r8/google-calendar-group-scheduler/SKILL.md)\n- google-calendar:google-calendar-meeting-prep: Build a practical meeting prep brief from a connected Google Calendar event and it (file: r8/google-calendar-meeting-prep/SKILL.md)\n- google-drive:google-docs: Prompt- and template-complete Google Docs creation an